    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever thought pomodoro timers were too boring or limited in features to keep you from using them and staying consistent?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polyfocus</strong> is a gamified productivity app to help you stay focused and get stuff done!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable timers, reward/progression systems, task lists, journaling, analytics, and lots more features to come in further developments.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just need a pomodoro timer to use right now? I've got you covered! <strong>Polyfocus Demo</strong> is just that with some additional but limited features you can customize and use to your own preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*<strong>Polyfocus</strong> will support both game and non-game versions for users to choose in the public beta options.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever thought pomodoro timers were too boring or limited in features to keep you from using them and staying consistent?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polyfocus</strong> is a gamified productivity app to help you stay focused and get stuff done!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable timers, reward/progression systems, task lists, journaling, analytics, and lots more features to come in further developments.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just need a pomodoro timer to use right now? I've got you covered! <strong>Polyfocus Demo</strong> is just that with some additional but limited features you can customize and use to your own preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*<strong>Polyfocus</strong> will support both game and non-game versions for users to choose in the public beta options.\u00a0</p>",
